          "emote": "Default",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "",
          "cameraDistance": "Far",
          "cameraHeight": "Default",
          "revealRadius": -1
        },
        {
          "words": "……所以我们去侦察目标区域。找到车队后，就阻止它抵达目的地。",
